  "bodyHash": "zgUCHgBsgTw=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1338/440/javaw_ocp2f9cnbu-copy.png\" alt=\"bg\" width=\"539\" height=\"539\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">這個模組在遊戲中加入了溫和的巨獸——海牛，也稱為海象。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以在河流中或海灘附近找到牠們的身影。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">牠們是慢速游泳者，但在驚慌時會加速前進。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以用海草和海藻來引誘牠們。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如果牠們長時間（5-10分鐘）待在水裡，</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">背上就會長出不同類型的藻類，直到你幫牠們清理乾淨。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以用海綿或刷子把藻類刷掉，</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">而在清理的過程中，牠們也會掉落一個在淺水區游蕩時卡在背上的物品。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使用海綿清理時，海綿不會損壞。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">在Forge中，你可以透過編輯data -> biome tags與biome modifier資料夾中的json檔案，或使用資源包來更改這些生成設定；在Fabric中則有對應的設定檔。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">在data -> tags -> item資料夾中也有json物品標籤檔案，</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">因此你可以更改清潔物品、常見、不常見、稀有物品掉落物，以及海牛的食物/引誘物品。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模組目前支援</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1 | 1.19.4 | 1.19.2 | 1.18.2</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1458/184/638946510197549497.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">鳴謝：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">FAU Harbor Branch Oceanographic Institute - 海牛的聲音</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Tom Hiddleston, Earthsounds</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>如果你需要不同版本的模組，或在CurseForge上遇到任何錯誤，請發送私人訊息給我。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><strong>在X（推特）上追蹤我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>本模組需要安裝AquariusLibs</strong></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
